<http://data.silknow.org/object/ae14b6b3-c727-37b6-847e-cb2836b244f6>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Letter case of embroidered silk. Pale green silk stiffened with card and lined with white taffeta. It contains two compartments and closes with a fold-over flap. All the edges are decorated with a fine ivory-coloured silk cord. The flat and front are embroidered with single floral sprays. On the back is a floral medallion containing the word 'souvenir'. The two inside surfaces are also worked with medallions containing sprays of flowers. It is finely embroidered with coloured silks in diagonal cross-stitch, stem, satin, long and short and split stitches with French knots."@en , "Letter case of embroidered silk with silks, England, ca. 1830"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/9b5ff024-2d9d-3ce1-9d75-d99792cc01c7> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/d2d66332-80f3-3d47-a562-17c3e4c55958> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Letter case of embroidered silk. Pale green silk stiffened with card and lined with white taffeta. It contains two compartments and closes with a fold-over flap. All the edges are decorated with a fine ivory-coloured silk cord. The flat and front are embroidered with single floral sprays. On the back is a floral medallion containing the word 'souvenir'. The two inside surfaces are also worked with medallions containing sprays of flowers. It is finely embroidered with coloured silks in diagonal cross-stitch, stem, satin, long and short and split stitches with French knots."@en , "Letter case of embroidered silk with silks, England, ca. 1830"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/ae14b6b3-c727-37b6-847e-cb2836b244f6/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/ae14b6b3-c727-37b6-847e-cb2836b244f6/dimension/1> ;
